Enter the Chef Express world and discover the benefits dedicated to you!

With the new APP you can access all the exclusive services reserved for Chef Express customers from your smartphone.

To start, register and immediately access your personalized loyalty program.

Through our application you can:
- access your virtual card at any time and obtain discounts and promotions reserved for you;
- stay up to date on the status of your profile;
- access the Webcam Park service;
- request the invoice for each transaction;
- find the store closest to you, and be informed about opening hours and services;
- access dedicated promotions;
- access the Booking Groups service to book your group parking in comfort

Download the APP and discover the customized program dedicated to your needs!

If you use your microwave just for baking or making food hot, this app is for you. Cooking food in a microwave is great fun, it is extremely easy and very much automated. 

You can cook nearly all Indian dishes using a microwave only. If you are planning to purchase a microwave, before you purchase, get well aware of dishes you can cook with a microwave. Easy steps and an easy set of ingredients are easily available in the market. 

This app has the largest collection of Indian and Continental recipes, with more than 300+ Auto cooks and over 50+ conventional recipes customized for Microwave Ovens. 

We offer you a lot of microwave recipes: baked recipes in the microwave, main dishes recipes in the microwave, sweet dishes recipes in the microwave, snack recipes, and other recipes in the microwave.

Recipes and cooking Tools are presented with simple and detailed instructions and photos.

Yummy baking recipes in the microwave: recipes of cupcakes in the microwave, biscuit recipes in the microwave, cake recipes, recipes of fruit pies, brownie recipes in the microwave, sweet bread recipes, recipes of muffins in the microwave, etc.;

- Recipes of hot sandwiches in the microwave;
- Recipes of baked potatoes in the microwave;
- A lot of recipes for barbecue in the microwave;
- Quick recipes of omelets for breakfast in the microwave;
- Recipes of lasagna in the microwave;
- Recipes of soups in the microwave;
- Other recipes for simple and quick dishes in the microwave and much more!

This unique app offers incredible features and benefits:
- An interactive recipe search by ingredients. Now find a recipe, based on ingredients available at home.
- An interactive oven panel detailing important product features for ease of use.
- Save your favorite recipes for quick access, anytime.
- Integrated Timer – Now you don’t have to wait in the kitchen while your favorite autocook recipe is prepared. Just sit back and relax, and let the app remind you about the next steps with mobile alerts.

Please install and share the app with your friends and family. We hope this app will help you. Please don't forget to rate us and add your comments. 
Your advice is always welcome. We are always there to act on your comments and give high importance to our audience.
